# does not settle: S-86 -- the flow seed never reads the setpoint, so the loop seeds at the nominal flow.
# Step 5 with its controls (a variant beside the ladder, P6.10): the secondary valve holds the
# secondary supply in place of the exchanger's stated outlet, as step 10 does, and the primary return
# is measured at its terminal.

fluidscript 1
circuit ladder
fluid water

NPS  inlet t=85 p=600
NPR  outlet p=350
PCV  valve

PU1  pump
HE1  heat_exchanger power=30 in.t=20 in[2].t=85 out[2].t=45
TE_S t_sensor at NS
TE_P t_sensor at NPR
TC1  pid kp=2
LOAD heat_exchanger power=-30
CV1  valve

connections
NPS - PCV
PCV - HE1.in[2] length=12 dn=25
HE1.out[2] - NPR

PU1 - HE1.in
HE1.out - NS - LOAD
LOAD - CV1
CV1 - PU1

control CV1 with TE_S by TC1 setpoint=50
